{"asset_key":"ep4/gameplay_story_14601360","episode":"ep4","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"14601360","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1460136001:1":{"text":"不愧是<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>，我很久没有这种在魔法上一败涂地的感觉了。","source_cn":"不愧是<style=stress><player_na...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0829A9CDAA5FE206","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"不愧是<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>，我很久没有这种在魔法上一败涂地的感觉了。","female":"不愧是<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>，我很久没有这种在魔法上一败涂地的感觉了。","variant_male_record_index":"167836","variant_female_record_index":"167837","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1460136002:1":{"text":"但也足够酣畅淋漓，对吧？很久没有这样尽情战斗过了！","source_cn":"但也足够酣畅淋漓，对吧？很久没有这样尽情战斗过了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96CBE243375A65A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1460136003:0":{"text":"我只是好强，但可不是好战……","source_cn":"我只是好强，但可不是好战……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6952868FC1734E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1460136004:0":{"text":"毕竟如果不拉你出门，你就宁愿在房间里一直喝着花茶研究魔法处理文书呢。","source_cn":"毕竟如果不拉你出门，你就宁愿在房间里一直喝着花茶研究魔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA50070530E355AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1460136005:0":{"text":"唔，原来如此。虽然我接触的魔法师不多，但许多沉稳认真，喜爱研究的学者都有类似的特征。","source_cn":"唔，原来如此。虽然我接触的魔法师不多，但许多沉稳认真，..